# Release Process

When the user asks to create a new release, **ask whether it is a major, minor, or patch release** if not explicitly specified. Do not assume patch.

## Files to update

Given current version `X.Y.Z`, bump to `X.Y.(Z+1)`:

1. **`build.gradle`** — update `version`
   ```groovy
   version = 'X.Y.(Z+1)'
   ```

2. **`validation/nextflow.config`** — update plugin reference
   ```groovy
   id 'nf-anndata@X.Y.(Z+1)'
   ```

3. **`CHANGELOG.md`** — three changes:
   - Promote all content under `## [Unreleased]` into a new versioned section (today's date, ISO format)
   - Leave `## [Unreleased]` empty above it
   - Add a comparison link at the bottom:
   ```
   [X.Y.(Z+1)]: https://github.com/nictru/nf-anndata/compare/vX.Y.Z...vX.Y.(Z+1)
   ```

## CHANGELOG section format

```markdown
## [Unreleased]

## [X.Y.(Z+1)] - YYYY-MM-DD

### Added

- **Short title** — description of change
```
